WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.634 --> 00:00:02.767
-Guys, today is Friday, and
that's usually when I catch up

00:00:02.767 --> 00:00:04.334
with some personal stuff.
I check my inbox,

00:00:04.334 --> 00:00:05.801
return some e-mails,
and, of course,

00:00:05.801 --> 00:00:06.934
I send out thank-you notes.

00:00:06.934 --> 00:00:08.467
And I was running a bit behind.

00:00:08.467 --> 00:00:10.067
[ Cheers and applause ]
Thank you very much.

00:00:10.067 --> 00:00:12.934
I'd like to write out a few
thank-you notes right now

00:00:12.934 --> 00:00:14.200
if you wouldn't mind.
James, can I get some

00:00:14.200 --> 00:00:15.868
thank-you-note-writing music,
please?

00:00:15.868 --> 00:00:17.467
♪♪
Ooh, there he is.

00:00:17.467 --> 00:00:19.567
Big "House of the Dragon" fan.
-Wow.

00:00:19.567 --> 00:00:21.701
-Loves --
-Loves High Valyrian.

00:00:21.701 --> 00:00:23.067
-Loves it.
[ Laughter ]

00:00:25.400 --> 00:00:28.868
Thank you, fall wreaths, for
being the international symbol

00:00:28.868 --> 00:00:30.934
for "someone's got a glue gun."

00:00:30.934 --> 00:00:32.801
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:33.501 --> 00:00:36.000
"Oh."
-"Oh, I burned my hand."

00:00:39.634 --> 00:00:43.534
-Thank you, Buccaneers vs. the
Chiefs, or as it's also known,

00:00:43.534 --> 00:00:45.133
the G.O.A.T. versus the goatee.

00:00:45.133 --> 00:00:46.434
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:52.968 --> 00:00:55.667
[ Chuckles ]
-It's a good one?

00:00:55.667 --> 00:00:57.167
That's a good one
you just thought of?

00:00:57.167 --> 00:00:59.000
[ Laughter ]
-I'm just thinking all these

00:00:59.000 --> 00:01:00.267
off the top of my head.
-Yeah, yeah, yeah.

00:01:00.267 --> 00:01:01.868
-I probably have three or four
more thoughts.

00:01:01.868 --> 00:01:04.033
-Yes.
[ Laughter ]

00:01:04.033 --> 00:01:05.701
-But this is definitely --
-Yeah. This -- Yeah.

00:01:08.400 --> 00:01:10.634
-Thank you,
New York City public schools,

00:01:10.634 --> 00:01:13.267
for offering more
plant-based meals.

00:01:13.267 --> 00:01:15.000
Soon the bullies will be like,

00:01:15.000 --> 00:01:16.801
"Hey, nerd, take
'my' lunch money."

00:01:16.801 --> 00:01:18.601
[ Laughter ]

00:01:18.601 --> 00:01:19.868
[ Cymbal crash ]

00:01:19.868 --> 00:01:21.300
-Hey-o!

00:01:25.267 --> 00:01:27.267
-That's a good one.
Yeah, that's great.

00:01:27.267 --> 00:01:32.701
[ Laughter ]

00:01:32.701 --> 00:01:34.400
"I don't want it.
Yeah, just take it."

00:01:36.467 --> 00:01:38.267
♪♪
-Oh, wow, your pen broke.

00:01:38.267 --> 00:01:39.501
[ Laughter ]

00:01:39.501 --> 00:01:41.501
Got to get a new pen.
-I got a different one.

00:01:41.501 --> 00:01:43.000
-That one's out of ink.
-Yeah.

00:01:43.000 --> 00:01:44.200
♪♪

00:01:44.200 --> 00:01:47.534
Thank you, challah,
for being bread with abs.

00:01:47.534 --> 00:01:51.067
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:56.501 --> 00:01:59.334
-Thank you, hotel cereal
dispensers,

00:01:59.334 --> 00:02:01.567
for being bird feeders
for businessmen.

00:02:01.567 --> 00:02:03.033
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:02:08.334 --> 00:02:15.801
-[ Imitating bird whistling ]

00:02:15.801 --> 00:02:17.400
[ Screeches ]

00:02:17.400 --> 00:02:19.167
[ Pop ]

00:02:19.167 --> 00:02:24.000
[ Laughter ]

00:02:25.667 --> 00:02:28.467
-Thank you, corn maze,
for being the most fun way

00:02:28.467 --> 00:02:29.934
to get trapped in a vegetable.

00:02:29.934 --> 00:02:32.234
There you have it, everybody.
Those are the thank-you notes.

00:02:32.234 --> 00:02:35.300
We'll be right back
with Zac Efron!

